                                                "sense_id": "892093ee-1f96-3679-b237-a1c3126e6783",
                                                "text": "His brain, after working at top speed during the day with the architect, the painter and decorator, the furnisher, the garden expert, the plumbing expert, the electric-light expert, the lawyer, the estate agent, and numberless other persons, during the night meditated and evolved advertisements."
                                            }
